</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.24</h2><ul><li><strong>Install silently says what was installed.</strong> With Settings → About → When an update is found set to Install silently, Blinky notifies you of the installed version and that release&#x27;s notes after it opens again. Check now still opens the update window. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/87">#87</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.24">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
